- **Result-only census** (`rows_test.cljc:1077-1097` + new `halted-result-closure` helper at `rows_support.cljc:486-495`): covers repeated vs independent cursors, topology/counts, and module-closure dependency completion — the union of four deleted `lift_v1` result-only tests plus the census/values closure tests. Needed consolidation.
